      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "smoke-test-template"
        },
        "markdown": "## Setup\n\nThe card to the right is one instance of `full-page-leaf` -- a node class with a Detail, Summary, Icon and Glyph chain, and **no Landing Surface**. The Bridge below imports the class so the instance resolves.\n\nTwo ways to see it:\n1. Focus the card here and zoom in -- it's an ordinary instance, so this is just camera movement.\n2. Open the class file directly as its own graph: `github://mikemartinez1974/public/qa/leaf-page-smoke/classes/full-page-leaf.node-class.node`. *This* is the real test -- it has to resolve where to land with nothing to fall back on."
      },
