        "markdown": "## Expected Result\n\nOpening the class file directly lands on its **Detail view**, full-size, immediately -- not on a landing card, not on an empty canvas. Verified by calling the app's own `resolveGraphNavigationExposure` against the file: `landingSurfaceNodeId` comes back empty and `focusNodeId` resolves to `full-page-leaf-detail-view` directly.\n\nCompare to `node-template` (which has a Landing Surface): the same function resolves `focusNodeId` to its landing content, not its Detail view. No Landing Surface means the Detail view *is* the landing -- a node file with a full view chain and nothing else already reads as a page when opened, with no separate mechanism required."
      },
